      "text": "(ii) Each payroll deduction for union dues shall be predicated upon a written authorization by the employee in a form prescribed by the Office of Payroll Administration (OPA). The authorization card shall be signed by each individual employee and filed by the employee organization with the payroll office of the department or agency where the member is employed.",
